<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Votre facture d'adhésion</title>
    <style>
        @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
            .ttm-container { width: 100% !important; }
            .ttm-body-cell { padding: 20px !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f4f4f4; color:#222;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f4f4;">
    <tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 10px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
               class="ttm-container" style="width:100%; max-width:600px; background:#fff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; border-collapse:collapse;">
            <tr>
                <td style="background:#0d2148; color:#fff; padding:20px; text-align:center;">
                    <h1 style="margin:0; font-size:22px; line-height:1.2;">Triathlon Toulouse Métropole</h1>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="ttm-body-cell" style="padding:24px; line-height:1.5;">
                    <p>Bonjour <strong>{{ user.prenom }}</strong>,</p>
                    <p>Vous trouverez ci-joint votre <strong>facture d'adhésion</strong> pour la saison
                       <strong>{{ season.name ?: season.id }}</strong>{% if season.startsAt and season.endsAt %}
                       ({{ season.startsAt|date('d/m/Y') }} → {{ season.endsAt|date('d/m/Y') }}){% endif %}.</p>
                    <p>Conservez-la pour vos remboursements employeur / mutuelle si concerné.</p>
                    <p style="margin-top:24px;">Sportivement,<br><em>L'équipe TTM</em></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
